# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_.

# false  -> talk to the FastAPI backend (kavach.api.app)
# true   -> use src/api/mock.ts, no backend needed
#
# The mock is not a stand-in for the system. Its numbers are hand-written, and
# its `expectedAnswerEntity` contains the real answer -- which the backend
# deliberately never sends. A screenshot of the mock is a screenshot of a
# design, not a result.
VITE_USE_MOCK=false

VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
